  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Whether you choose to regard it as an illusion, a sleight, a spell, or an invocation, this pamphlet is best thought of in terms of magic(k). This may seem confusing at first, especially since "magic" means many things to many people. The Center for Tactical Magic does not exclusively align itself with any one interpretation of "magic", in part because it is the vast range of interpretations that give magic(k)-both with and without the "K"-power in the world of meaning. Therefore this mini grimoire is likely to exploit many of your preconceptions of magic(k) in an effort to dislodge your comfortable sensibilities."--</subfield>
